<title>USA: NY/NJ Port Authority bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>NY/NJ Port Authority bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Friday it repriced and restructured Port Authority of New York and New Jersey's $943 million JFK International Airport bonds, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2025 to 6.10 percent from 6.14 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>THE PORT AUTHORITY OF NEW YORK AND NEW JERSEY</p>
<p>RE: $943,130,000*</p>
<p>Special Project Bonds, Series 6</p>
<p>JFK International Air Terminal LLC Project</p>
<p>Verbal award.</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 04/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/01/2003		5,500M    5.125 %	  5.20</p>
<p>12/01/2004		9,500M    5.20  %	  5.30</p>
<p>12/01/2005	     21,500M    6.00  %	  5.40</p>
<p>12/01/2006	     24,435M    6.00  %	  5.45</p>
<p>12/01/2007	     25,895M    6.00  %	  5.48</p>
<p>12/01/2008	     27,400M    6.25  %	  5.55</p>
<p>12/01/2009	     29,100M    6.25  %	  5.60</p>
<p>12/01/2010	     30,950M    6.25  %	  5.67</p>
<p>12/01/2011	     32,850M    6.25  %	  5.69</p>
<p>12/01/2012	     34,950M    7.00  %	  5.70</p>
<p>12/01/2013	     37,150M    6.25  %	  5.73</p>
<p>12/01/2014	     39,400M    6.25  %	  5.75</p>
<p>12/01/2015	     41,900M    6.25  %	  5.77</p>
<p>12/01/2017	     91,500M	NRO	     -</p>
<p>12/01/2022    **    280,250M    5.75  %	  6.06</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 95.993)</p>
<p>12/01/2025   ***    210,850M    5.75  %	  6.10</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 95.29 )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: Serials: Non-Callable</p>
<p>		   2017 &amp; 2022: 12/1/07  102%</p>
<p>				    DTP in 2009</p>
<p>			    2025: 12/1/07  100%</p>
<p>**  Subject to special mandatory redemption at par in the event the City Lease is not extended to or beyond December 31, 2025 by December 1, 2011*. See &quot;Description of the Series 6 Bonds - Redemption of Series 6 Bonds -Special Mandatory Redemption&quot; in Part 1.</p>
<p>*** Subject to special mandatory redemption at par in the event the City Lease is not extended to or beyond December 31, 2025 by December 1, 2001*. See &quot;Description of the Series 6 Bonds - Redemption of Series 6 Bonds -Special Mandatory Redemption&quot; in Part 1.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, April 25, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on May 13, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
